dth: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nThe trajectory \n<div id=\"selectList-335021-0\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-335021-0\" style=\"width: 111px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">circles around</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1; left: 510px; top: 23192px;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">approaches</div><div class=\"selectListOption selected\" style=\"height: 17px;\">circles around</div></div></div><div id=\"selectList-335021-1\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 2px 2px 4px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-335021-1\" style=\"width: 174px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">the nonzero equilibrium</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1; left: 645px; top: 23192px;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">the origin</div><div class=\"selectListOption selected\" style=\"height: 17px;\">the nonzero equilibrium</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">the point of inflection</div></div></div>.<p></p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"437\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"445\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX